{"root":{"data":{"id":"dl28u5ia5r40","created":1788089528897,"text":"Color OS16系统"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2ptjgyo9s0","created":1788137439797,"text":"系统定义"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2ptw4otoo0","created":1788137467353,"text":"操作系统本质是硬件 和 应用程序（App）中间的一层管理者。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2pw0ci7h40","created":1788137633261,"text":"引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2pw4rzbq00","created":1788137642904,"text":"极光引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2px44bzpk0","created":1788137719838,"text":"转场动画连贯 “从哪来回哪去”，点击响应、滑动帧率稳定性提升；\n不只系统 UI，第三方 App 也接入这套渲染调度。","layout_left_offset":{"x":-57.99999956786644,"y":-9.999999925494194}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2pwh8mlls0","created":1788137670032,"text":"潮汐引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2pxdxynrk0","created":1788137741221,"text":"软件和手机 SoC 芯片深度协同，毫秒级动态升降算力，动画线程优先调度。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q08l2o680","created":1788137964650,"text":"繁星编译器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2q0hrmla00","created":1788137984637,"text":"OPPO全新自研编译器通过业界独创跨级融合编译，大幅提升了编译语言的执行效率，\n助力系统响应更迅速、更流畅，让全价位机型都有顶级的流畅体验。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}